                    "note": "**** Bank Transfer Refund Link Sent to passenger**** \n\nBTRF 440.00\n\nA refund has been actioned on this booking by the Refunds Team. The customer will be receiving their refund by Bank Transfer. The customer will receive an email within 3 - 5 working days which will advise that they need to click on the link and enter their bank details. \n\nOnce the customer has done this and submitted the required information, they will receive the refund in their bank account within the next 5 - 7 days. \n\nOnce this refund has been processed, we will apply a bank transfer to the booking. \n\nPLEASE DO NOTE MAKE ANY AMENDMENTS TO THIS BOOKING OR LOG ANOTHER REFUND UNTIL THIS BANK TRANSFER REFUND HAS BEEN APPLIED TO THE BOOKING. \n\nIf you have any questions, please contact your team leader who will be able to assist.",
                    "displayName": "Michelle M Corbin",
                    "dateModified": "2023-11-06T08:47:15",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~6",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 7,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Ref - 6465965\nEvie Birkett\n​\nAccounts\n​\nHi,\n\nHope you are well.\n\nThese pax are due a refund of £440, the email for it to be bank transferred was sent 6/11/23 but they never saw it. Could this email for the refund to be processed be resent please.\n\nKind Regards,\n\nEvie Birkett",
                    "displayName": "Evie Birkett",
                    "dateModified": "2023-12-21T13:56:48",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~7",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 8,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Accounts\n​\nEvie Birkett\n​\nHi Evie,\n\n \n\nAs we are no longer dealing with refunds hence can you please connect with refunds team HQVirginHolidays.Refunds@fly.virgin.com on your below query.\n\n \n\nRegards,\n\n \n\nJeetendra Vengurlekar",
                    "displayName": "Evie Birkett",
