                {
                    "no": 9,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Evie Birkett\n​\nHQVirginHolidays Refunds\n​\nHi,\n\nHope you are well.\n\nThe pax on this ref are due a refund of £440 and an email was sent in November to bank transfer the refund but they missed it. Are you able to resend the refund.\n\nThank you,\nEvie",
                    "displayName": "Evie Birkett",
