                {
                    "no": 10,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Ref 6465965\nEvie Birkett\n​\nHQVirginHolidays Refunds\n​\nHi,\n\n \n\nHope you are well.\n\n \n\nThese pax are due a refund of £440, the email for it to be bank transferred was sent 6/11/23 but they never saw it. Could this email for the refund to be processed and resent please if possible.\n\n \n\nKind Regards,\n\n\nEvie Birkett",
