                {
                    "no": 12,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Dear Mrs TestLNameOne,\n\nWe are writing to let you know that there has been an update on your Virgin Atlantic Holidays booking and the following flight change impacts your travel plans. \n   \nPlease see your revised flight times below: \n\n\nOriginal Flights:\n\nVS 3 \t\tLondon Heathrow \n22 Dec 2025, 09:00 \tNew York J F Kennedy \n22 Dec 2025, 12:20 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nVS 138 \t\tNew York J F Kennedy \n27 Dec 2025, 20:45 \tLondon Heathrow \n28 Dec 2025, 08:35 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\nNew Flights :\n\nVS 3 \t \tLondon Heathrow \n22 Dec 2025, 09:00 \tNew York J F Kennedy \n22 Dec 2025, 12:20 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nVS 46 \t \tNew York J F Kennedy \n27 Dec 2025, 19:01 \tLondon Heathrow \n28 Dec 2025, 06:55  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\nPlease get in touch if you have any questions about the changes, no matter how small, simply by replying to this email.  \n  \nPlease note if you have pre-booked your seats this may have been changed.  Whist we do endeavour to re-select these, this may not always be possible so please log on to the airline’s website directly to review your booking. \n  \nIf we don’t hear from you before you go, have a great time away. \n \nKind Regards, \n\n\nMichelle \nFlight Changes Team\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays",
                    "displayName": "Michelle A Arney",
                    "dateModified": "2025-01-30T15:04:58",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~12",
                    "noteId": 0
                }
            ],
            "advNotes": [
                {
                    "no": 1,
                    "code": "Luggage allowance & Seating - all airlines",
                    "description": "Luggage allowance & Seating - all airlines",
                    "note": "Please note:  Airline luggage allowances can vary depending on whether you are \nflying on an international or domestic/internal flight.  Please ensure you check with \nthe airline you are booked on, for their luggage allowances and any relevant \ncharges.\n\nSeating with airlines can be chargeable and some require\ntickets to be issued before seating can be assigned. \nFor tickets to be issued we would require full payment to be made.\n\nOnce tickets are issued they are non changeable and non refundable.",
                    "dateModified": "2022-03-27T10:15:26",
