                    "code": "RIU Plaza Manhattan Times Square - Resort Fee",
                    "description": "RIU Plaza Manhattan Times Square - Resort Fee",
                    "note": "RIU Plaza Manhattan Times Square have a mandatory resort fee of $29 per \nroom per night, plus tax which is payable locally. In order to settle this cost, \nyou will need to pay at the hotel when you check in.\n\nThe resort fee is set by the accommodation provider, not the tour operator, so \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays cannot control the level of the fee, and it can change at any time.\n\nFor the most up to date details of the charges, taxes and inclusions, please \ncheck the hotel’s website.",
